{"slug":"services-api","title":"Services API","desc":"","og":"https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Nexus-API-hero.png","content":"<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/hero {\"label\":\"Services API\",\"title\":\"API for Workforce Management Systems\",\"intro\":\"Protect staff and manage work using one app\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Book a Demo\",\"link\":\"\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"demo-dialog\",\"variant\":\"\"},{\"linkText\":\"Get a Quote\",\"link\":\"/uk/get-your-quote/\",\"linkTarget\":false,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2025/01/Nexus-API-hero.png@@\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/trustpilot-widget {\"widget\":\"horizontal\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"preTitle\":\"Higher adoption\",\"title\":\"Increase worker protection\",\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2024/08/iStock-850712896.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Drive increased usage and adoption when your team only need to use their Workforce Management app to enable protection on their <a href=\"/uk/products/sos-app/\">Peoplesafe app</a>.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Checking in and out of shifts and setting timed activity alarms for jobs are set automatically, providing benefits such as:</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:list -->\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Increased safety management</strong> – integration means all users set safety alarms and check-ins on every shift</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item -->\n\n<!-- wp:list-item -->\n<li><strong>Reduced app fatigue</strong> – users only need to interact with the Workforce Management app regularly</li>\n<!-- /wp:list-item --></ul>\n<!-- /wp:list -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">See how to implement this</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media {\"title\":\"Download Brochure\",\"buttons\":[{\"linkText\":\"Download Product Brochure\",\"link\":\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/12/5/?teaser=yes\",\"linkTarget\":true,\"dialog\":\"\",\"variant\":\"outline\"}],\"imageId\":\"@@img:https://peoplesafe.co.uk/wp-content/uploads/2022/01/product-brochure-turtl.jpg@@\",\"framed\":false,\"mediaPosition\":\"left\"} -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Want to learn more about how the Services API can enhance the safety and security of your lone workers?</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Download our comprehensive product brochure for detailed information on its features and benefits.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Discover how the Services API works with your workforce management system to create 100% usage of our personal safety solution.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p><a href=\"https://insights.peoplesafe.co.uk/story/product-brochure/page/12/5/?teaser=yes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Download Product Brochure</a></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- /wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/text-and-media -->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/cta-banner {\"theme\":\"orange\",\"title\":\"See how it works\",\"content\":\"\\u003cp\\u003eTo get a Services API and Nexus demo, contact our experts using the form below:\\u003c/p\\u003e\"} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:cb-peoplesafe2027/form {\"formUrl\":\"https://safe.peoplesafe.co.uk/l/830213/2024-03-05/2hl7qq\",\"height\":550} /-->","menu_order":13,"types":["api","features"]}